Suspicious pattern 1: Dense subgraph (collusion ring)
  A small set of clients only hire a small set of freelancers,
  with no connections to the rest of the marketplace.

Suspicious pattern 2: Temporal correlation
  Client signs up → posts job within 1 hour → hires within 24h
  → both accounts go dormant after the review is left.

Suspicious pattern 3: Financial fingerprint
  Client and freelancer share: payment instrument, IP range,
  device fingerprint, or bank account.
